  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 302.40 United States Gov’t Armed Forces",
  "priorExpiration": "2017-06-30",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 302.40 “United States Gov’t Armed Forces” means the United States Army, Army Reserve, Navy, Naval Reserve, Marine Corps, Marine Corps Reserve, Air Force, Air Force Reserve, Coast Guard, Coast Guard Reserve, Army National Guard, and the Air National Guard.\n\nSource. #12058, INTERIM, eff 1-1-17, EXPIRED: 6-30-17\n\nNew. #12520, eff 4-25-18; ss by #13186, eff 4-7-21 (formerly Saf-C 302.37)",
